{"unit_id":"TacitSay__dsh-compact-arsenal#card-zh","repo":"TacitSay/dsh-compact-arsenal","commit":"fab4ffae175d82b95428236d14e895b75f91074b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-arsenal（DSH 网页插件）：按需压缩会话上下文，并在侧栏提供可视化控制面板。它在每步处理会话状态，可分别处理较早的整轮对话、助手推理片段和工具结果。总压缩生成检查点；推理与工具内容可选择保留头尾、清除或用模型提炼要点。用户可设置各模式开关、阈值和模型参数，面板显示运行统计；压缩内容另存为归档。适合希望控制长会话上下文占用的 DSH 网页用户。模型模式使用当前会话模型或配置的模型，功能默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:186-210","index.js:471-508","client.js:340-455"]}
{"unit_id":"TacitSay__dsh-compact-arsenal#card-en","repo":"TacitSay/dsh-compact-arsenal","commit":"fab4ffae175d82b95428236d14e895b75f91074b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-compact-arsenal is a DSH web plugin for long chats. It turns older turns into checkpoints, trims or clears reasoning, and shortens tool results. A sidebar configures modes and thresholds and shows run statistics. Model modes use the current or configured model; compaction starts disabled.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:186-210","index.js:471-508","client.js:340-455"]}
